{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25460","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 瀑泉亭 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 瀑泉亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向老多悲恨，凄然念一丘。\n岩泉终古在，风月几年游。\n菌阁饶佳树，菱潭有钓舟。\n不如羊叔子，名与岘山留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}